  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centre for Democratic Governance (CGD) 2019-2024 - Evaluation support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Centre for Democratic Governance (CGD) 2019-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity period: 2019-05-23 - 2024-03-31

Budget: 15 099 986 SEK

Partner: Centre pour la Gouvernance D&#xe9;mocratique (CGD) 

Other donors: Denmark

The overall objective of the program was to contribute to strengthen the democracy and promote the good governance in Burkina Faso through the production of knowledge, the creation of spaces for dialogue and the questioning of actors of democratic governance. To achieve this overall objective, the project was structured in three (03) axes: 

Axis 1: Strengthening constitutionalism, the rule of law and political and socio-economic governance;
Axis 2: Promoting civic awareness, civility, social cohesion and good governance in the security sector;
Axis 3: Institutional support and organizational strengthening of the CGD

No major amendements to the agreement were done during the agreement period.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida avser st&#xf6;dja le Centre pour la Gouvernance D&#xe9;mocratique med 15 miljoner SEK f&#xf6;r projektet &quot;st&#xe4;rka r&#xe4;ttsstatens principer, fr&#xe4;mja medvetenhet och demokratisk styrning i Burkina Faso&quot; under perioden 2019-2023.

Insatsen syftar till att bidra till ett fredligt samh&#xe4;lle med stabila institutioner. F&#xf6;r att n&#xe5; detta m&#xe5;l st&#xf6;ds tre huvudsakliga omr&#xe5;den: 

1: att st&#xe4;rka konstitutionen, r&#xe4;ttsstatens principer samt politisk och socioekonomisk styrning; 
2: att fr&#xe4;mja social sammanh&#xe5;llning och god styrning inom s&#xe4;kerhetssektorn; 
3: att fr&#xe4;mja institutionell utveckling av CGD.

Interventionens totala budget &#xe4;r cirka 17 700 000 kronor, varav Sidas bidrag &#xe4;r 15 miljoner kronor fr&#xe5;n 2019 till 2023 och ytterligare 300 000 kronor f&#xf6;r halvtids- och slututv&#xe4;rderingar 2021 och 2024. Danmark kommer att bidra ca 2, 4 miljoner kronor fr&#xe5;n 2019 till 2020.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida will support le Centre pour la Gouvernance D&#xe9;mocratique with 15 million SEK to carry out the project &quot;strengthening the rule of law, promoting civic awareness and democratic governance in Burkina Faso&quot; during the period 2019-2023 and additional 300 000 SEK for a mid-term and final evaluation respectively in 2021 and 2024. 

The intervention will support the construction of a peaceful society with stable institutions. To reach this objective, the cooperation partner has identified three areas: 
1: Strengthening the constitution, the rule of law and political as well as socio-economic governance;
2: Promoting civil society,  social cohesion and good governance in the security sector;
3: Building the institutional development of CGD.

The intervention&#x2019;s total budget is approximately 17 700 000 SEK, out of which Sida&#xb4;s contribution is 15 million kronor from 2019 to 2023 and additional 300 000 SEK for a mid-term and final evaluations in 2021 and 2024.  Denmark will contribute approximately 2,4 million SEK from 2019 to 2020.</narrative>
  </description>
